  "mach:judgementReason": "Comprehensive computational pathology toolkit from a leading cancer institute. Covers the full WSI pipeline with PyTorch integration and strong documentation. 452 stars, GPL-2.0 (note licence implications for commercial use). Assess due to GPL licence and moderate community size. Strong institutional provenance from Dana-Farber makes it a credible choice for oncology research groups building pathology AI pipelines.",
